# Build context hygiene for the vector-sigma deploy image.
# The compose file sets build context to the repo root; keep everything
# that is host-local, vendored, or secret out of the image layers.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
.gitignore
**/coverage
**/.env
**/*.log
deploy/.env
docs
README.md